{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_020_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2860037e401be47e211d04bb7b0c598cf5ffd31335cd57296c510339da6798c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09b91c23f33b227d1f6ce1d54bb2f44c1606615af9453c60f29ca3f99a14434b",
      "text": "隼人的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb1eda21f96ea58e82b76ff226a670e3e058c4087f12d05e17c8478a7df4b885",
      "text": "……好奇怪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89cf5e0a2811a19856b94be1943cde6c1c47492a237cf5825dda7f14f88dd435",
      "text": "（最近大家到底怎么了。\n总觉得心神不宁的，感觉怪怪的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca4d3cef0f7c045a12abc01b0824c16c0e3884c42842bfc0cc631c433fc1d3a0",
      "text": "简直就像是在瞒着我\n做些什么事情一样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5792ce177f4c52cffc2a94c217d33b9e6af21ed2feb623e3fc5d2397b4d6fa30",
      "text": "（关于曲子的事肯定会跟我商量的，\n除了那个还有什么事吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0a00d2b47281b39e97b4e7adaa7c253c557e170e463d50f94437b4b9b81a97",
      "text": "……啊！\n马上就是我的生日了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3561370fafe246c7da60d87f0f446dfae5832ca0bed999258d0d0abcc9767d7",
      "text": "难道说……大家是打算在生日那天\n为我准备什么吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06547054b16ed792024acfbb9821e88c8b59c758a7ad9527340943c734ba770d",
      "text": "不不怎么可能……！但是看大家的\n表现，可能性并不是零啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a734478cda415d4d1301d728bac25a7c06973f8225834fa5d71351e89a9dd21",
      "text": "哇——……要是真的那我可太开心了。\n糟了，嘴角忍不住翘起来了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64934f52fd86dce837d31dbc239e997783a0245f24403bf888a51d147bbe0bcf",
      "text": "不行不行，既然大家是在秘密准备，\n那我就得装作没发现才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57e646db24c7bd1cdda0f8fbb16e383858e0e61acc45cb22dddd6c6fe66beb0b",
      "text": "嗯。我什么都不知道！什么都没看见，\n什么都没察觉到！就按这个路线来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e22aa7fb7ef9910db7b83208cedceae55551502bc2a9893a2ea162ce2fd9518",
      "text": "……好期待啊。嘿嘿……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
